Attribution — three.js r187, vendored for Solmar Heat v3 (gta 06 v3).
The game loads it offline from game/vendor/three.module.min.js (which
re-exports game/vendor/three.core.min.js) through the import map in
game/index.html. No code in these files was written by the entry authors;
the library is used exactly as published, under its MIT license below.
